# ACCESS_POLICY

Who can reach the brain over MCP and what each caller is allowed to do.
memex's only ingress is `POST /mcp` (plus `GET /health`); access is
decided by which credential the request presents.

## Credentials

| Credential | Identity | Trust level |
|---|---|---|
| Public MCP bearer | rotated daily, fronted by Cloudflare | read-only |
| Internal token (`MEMEX_INTERNAL_TOKEN`) | recipe / worker callers on the docker bridge | full |

## Trust levels

- **full**: any MCP tool call — read or write (`page_put`, `index`, …).
- **read-only**: read tools only; write tools are hidden from
  `tools/list` and rejected on call, and note-derived free text is
  redacted on public ingress.
- **denied**: request rejected (401/403).

## Override rules

(Cases where the policy bends — e.g. `MEMEX_PUBLIC_WRITE=1` opts the
public ingress into write access; pair it with daily bearer rotation.)
